{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FiresOut! is a chaotic couch co-op firefighting game for up to four players where teamwork makes the dream work... or total disaster! You and your friends play as animal firefighter interns who definitely did <i>not</i> sign up to rescue the entire neighborhood (but the captain believes in &quot;hands-on learning&quot; so here you are.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/f9bf4c49948cf4bf725c86c7259e725d.poster.avif?t=1768293622\" aria-label=\"Players steering Mr Glug Glug while Mr Glug Glug shooting water from his mouth\" width=1148 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/f9bf4c49948cf4bf725c86c7259e725d.webm?t=1768293622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/f9bf4c49948cf4bf725c86c7259e725d.mp4?t=1768293622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>TEAMWORK MAKES THE FISH WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to aim Mr. Glug Glug -a goldfish living in a toilet who blasts water like a fire hose. Make sure to manage the recoils - hang on to your (toilet) seat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/1a15a3a7eb2f04166d4fdcea3fb2b9de.poster.avif?t=1768293622\" aria-label=\"Players working together, moving Mr Glug Glug , the toilet fish\" width=1148 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/1a15a3a7eb2f04166d4fdcea3fb2b9de.webm?t=1768293622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/1a15a3a7eb2f04166d4fdcea3fb2b9de.mp4?t=1768293622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SQUEEZE THE DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight corridors, winding stairs, falling debris and the occasional meteor while hauling your tools across burning chaos. With spaces this cramped, you'll need teamwork, timing and maybe a little friendly shoving to squeeze through in one piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/86fe11fe3c7999f72aaf14d64122d470.poster.avif?t=1768293622\" aria-label=\"Player saving a victim from burning home\" width=1150 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/86fe11fe3c7999f72aaf14d64122d470.webm?t=1768293622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/86fe11fe3c7999f72aaf14d64122d470.mp4?t=1768293622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GRAB 'N' GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop up fire victims and haul them to safety. Just don't forget to douse them first! \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fires solo or up to 4 players as firefighting interns. Support both local couch or online chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet gold fish as your fire extinguisher (his name's Mr Glug Glug).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry victims or yeet them. They're covered by insurance, anyway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your fire truck between 5 wacky worlds with unique game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocking fireballs, time bomb fireballs. Wait... we shouldn't send interns for this.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","back